config BR2_PACKAGE_PODD
	bool "podd"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  podd — the open control daemon + web UI for the Eight Sleep Pod.

	  Installs the static aarch64 podd binary and the built SPA. The
	  binary itself is cross-compiled outside Buildroot via
	  `nix build .#podd-aarch64` (and the UI via `nix build .#ui`); this
	  package stages the results into the rootfs and wires up the systemd
	  service. Point PODD_BIN / PODD_UI_DIR at those `result-*` paths (see
	  package/podd/podd.mk).

	  https://git.neet.dev/zuckerberg/podd
